# SubscriptionCard on DemoPage

## Source of truth
- Only real call site: `ProfileSubscriptionCards.vue` inside `ProfileSubscriptionPopup` (modes: `switch`, `subscribe`, `free-paid`, `paid-upgrade`, `paid-to-free`, `paid-downgrade`).
- Demo shows: the real `v-for` loop Show Code, plus one isolated card per look — featured+Upgrade, current, Downgrade, subscribe CTA, free plan.
- Show Code uses feature `t()` keys under `subscriptionCard.*` — never `demo.` for card copy.
- Images via `useAssetUrl('subscriptionCard.demo.bg…')`. Prefer `static` for isolated demos (carousel `order` is for the popup).
- Feature-list rows use `CheckboxGroup` with `theme="subscriptionFeature"` (always checked, decorative, centered white SVG tick).

## Do not demo
- Five near-identical standard cards.
- File-name captions (“Card 2 — Featured”) above samples.
- Dark section stage backgrounds.
